        "OBJECTS: item.simple_travelers_clothes (Simple Traveler's Clothes, held by Alaric, equipped: clothing) · item.starter_arcane_staff_r2 (Starter Arcane Staff, held by Alaric, equipped: weapon) · item.starter_light_robes (Starter Light Robes, held by Alaric, equipped: armor) · item.small_pouch (Small Pouch, held by Alaric)\n" +
